      "changeReason": "V1.20: the V1.19 layout F cap, unprinted, carried unchanged. the V1.17 layout F cap with each of its four screw-head floors thickened from 1.0 to 3.0 mm. The printed V1.17 cap's two low floors tore into open holes when it was taken off (Shawn 2026-10-15, IMG_7004). The floors grow 2.0 mm forward (column fronts x -53.1 low, -52.6 top), so the head seats (x -56.1 / -55.6), the four stock M2 x 10 and the thread engagement (3.9 / 4.6 mm) are unchanged; the +y low column is flattened to 0.5 mm above the USB-C socket. Gaps: 1.5 mm to the 5991 PCB, 1.25 mm to the 7 V board, cap to boards 0.287 mm (unchanged walls). Evidence: back-plate/layout-F/raycast_cap_screws.json and post_build.json.",
